{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國慶煙花晚上八時在維港上空綻放。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第一幕先由金色錦冠煙花打響頭炮，配上藍綠色球狀煙花，象徵中華大地的山脈與江河。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIREWORK 2030.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ndmHZMAcIy1790862028.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIREWORK 2030.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">緊接有金紅色「太陽花」升起，象徵希望、溫暖及堅定信念，為市民送上正能量。之後一幕，紫荊花及牡丹在夜空盛開，配上張學友歌曲《留住這時光》，寓意香港人的珍貴回憶。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIREWORK 2030_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267GFD40Ig5V1790862065.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIREWORK 2030_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次國慶煙花匯演，共發放逾三萬枚煙花，維港兩岸都迫滿來觀賞的市民及遊客。其中尖沙咀海旁一帶，人潮伸延至彌敦道，人人都用手機記錄璀璨一刻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T13:59:50.218774+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}